<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ancestralidade Viva | Cultura Indígena</title>
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #5c4033; --secondary: #e2725b; --accent: #2d5a27; --light: #fdfaf6; --dark: #222; }
        body { font-family: sans-serif; margin: 0; background-color: var(--light); color: var(--dark); scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        header { background-color: var(--primary); color: white; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; }
        nav { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; background: #4a342a; padding: 15px; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1000; }
        nav a { color: white; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
        .section-title { text-align: center; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 40px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--secondary); padding-bottom: 10px; }
        .products { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
        .product-card { background: white; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .product-image { width: 100%; height: 400px; object-fit: cover; background: #eee; }
        .product-info { padding: 20px; }
        .story-box { background: #f0e6dd; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 15px 0; border-left: 4px solid var(--secondary); }
        .btn-buy { display: block; background: var(--accent); color: white; text-align: center; padding: 12px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; }
        footer { background: var(--dark); color: white; text-align: center; padding: 40px 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
    <h1>Ancestralidade Viva</h1>
    <p>Arte e Sabedoria dos Povos Originários</p>
</header>
<nav>
    <a href="#">INÍCIO</a>
    <a href="#produtos">PRODUTOS</a>
</nav>
<div class="container" id="produtos">
    <h2 class="section-title">Coleção Autêntica</h2>
    <div class="products">
        <div class="product-card">
            <img src="IMG_0579.jpeg" alt="Arte Kayapó" class="product-image">
            <div class="product-info">
                <h3>Grafismo Nhak-Moro</h3>
                <div class="story-box"><strong>História:</strong> Representa a pele da serpente e a proteção do povo Kayapó.</div>
                <a href="https://wa.me/SEUNUMERO" class="btn-buy">Comprar via WhatsApp</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card">
            <img src="IMG_0580.jpeg" alt="Colar de Jarina" class="product-image">
            <div class="product-info">
                <h3>Colar de Jarina</h3>
                <div class="story-box"><strong>História:</strong> Feito de Marfim Vegetal colhido de forma sustentável.</div>
                <a href="https://wa.me/5596991012212" class="btn-buy">Comprar via WhatsApp</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<footer><p>&copy; 2026 Ancestralidade Viva</p></footer>
</body>
</html>

